			"Message": "style(Mist): Reflow markdown text and standardise table formatting in README and DeepDive\n\nReflow prose paragraphs in both README.md and Documentation/GitHub/DeepDive.md to stay within the project line-width convention, preventing hard-wrap inconsistencies that cause noisy diffs on subsequent edits.\n\nStandardise all markdown tables across both files: add alignment dashes, normalise column widths, and apply consistent spacing between pipe delimiters. Fix the Related Documentation indentation in README.md from tabs to standard two-space continuation.\n\nNo content changes — formatting and whitespace only.",
