			"Message": "style(Mist): Format code and doc-comment whitespace across four sources\n\nNormalise inconsistent whitespace in Source files: fix tab-indented code in Library.rs doc examples (tabs→spaces), reflow wide doc-comment lines in Resolver.rs and Zone.rs to stay under the project line-width convention, remove a trailing blank line in WebSocket's ServeLocal telemetry call, break long chained closures in AuthorizeUpgrade and ConnectWithSecret across multiple lines, and add vertical spacing between parameters in AuthorizeUpgrade's signature.\n\nNo functional changes — formatting and whitespace only.",
